# The few wayland-protocols files BUI's Wayland host is built from, for machines without the
# wayland-protocols package (whose pkg-config file BUI's build looks for). Without either, BUI
# builds without native Wayland windows: no layer-shell overlay, only X11 through XWayland.
pkgdatadir=${pcfiledir}/protocols

Name: Wayland Protocols
Description: The protocols BUI's Wayland host needs (from the wayland-protocols crate)
Version: 1.45
